          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"testimonials3 businessm4_testimonials3\" group=\"Testimonials\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n\t\t<select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\">1</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t\t<header>Show / Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"SubTitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Desk\" name=\"showDesk\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Card\" name=\"cardBg\" value=\"#f4f8fa\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Header Color1\" name=\"headerColor1\" value=\"#f4f8fa\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Header Color2\" name=\"headerColor2\" value=\"#8b1b1b\">\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Background Image\" value>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Background Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Background Video\" value=\"https://youtu.be/iM-NestDPNQ\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#efefef\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.9\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mb-3 align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>Sugar Reset Reviews- Trusted USA User Experiences</b></h2>\n\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-text mbr-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mbr-light align-center\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-subtitle\">\n\t\t\tLorem Ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit.\n\t\t</h3>\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\" mbr-class=\"{'pt-2':showTitle||showSubtitle}\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/user3.webp\" alt=\"Reviews 1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJames K. From Florida, USA</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style align-left m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“<a href=\"https://us-sugarreset.us\" class=\"text-black\"><b>Sugar Reset</b> </a>has been a simple addition to my daily wellness routine. I wanted extra support for maintaining healthy blood sugar while also paying more attention to my meals and activity. I like that it fits easily into my schedule without making my routine complicated. Staying consistent with healthy habits feels easier when I have a clear daily plan.”</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"underline align-left\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text card-sign mbr-fonts-style align-left mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".card-sign,.underline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tManaging Director\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\t\t\t<div class=\"card col-12 col-md-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-box\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-header\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card-img\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/user2-120x123.webp\" alt=\"Reviews 2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mbr-white\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-img\"><b>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRobert M. From New York, USA</b></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text card-text mbr-fonts-style align-left m-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\">“I started using Sugar Reset as part of my regular wellness routine and have enjoyed how easy it is to include each day. I am also focusing on balanced meals, regular walks, and better hydration. For me, it works as an additional source of daily nutritional support while I continue working toward healthier blood sugar and metabolic wellness goals.”</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"underline align-left\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"line\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-text card-sign mbr-fonts-style align-left mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDesk\" data-app-selector=\".card-sign,.underline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tManaging Director\n\t\t\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
